Ney: 10-09 14:07:55
要把这个项目传到自己仓库上，要在根目录建一个.gitignore文件，内容如下：
# dependencies
**/node_modules/

# environment files
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# frontend and general build output
**/dist/
**/build/
**/.vite/

# Hardhat output
**/artifacts/
**/cache/
**/typechain/
**/typechain-types/
**/coverage/
**/coverage.json

# logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# editor files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/

# operating system files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

